{"type":"after","callId":"call@153","endTime":54796.512,"result":{"value":"Rubric generation\nGap analysis\nVersion history\nExplainable scores\nAudit trail\nRAG assistant\nBloom’s taxonomy\nCO / PO mapping\nSimilarity detection\nAssessment blueprints\nRubric generation\nGap analysis\nVersion history\nExplainable scores\nAudit trail\nRAG assistant\nBloom’s taxonomy\nCO / PO mapping\nSimilarity detection\nAssessment blueprints\nFacultyLens\nFeatures\nHow It Works\nPricing\nAbout\nSign In\nRegister\n\nFACULTY REGISTRATION\n\nCreate Faculty Account\n\nAdd your department details to provision a private academic workspace for your courses.\n\nFULL NAME*\nUNIVERSITY EMAIL*\n\nValid university email is required\n\nDEPARTMENT*\nDESIGNATION*\nPASSWORD*\n\nPassword must be at least 6 characters\n\nCONFIRM PASSWORD*\n\nPasswords do not match\n\nPassword strength\nWeak\nI agree to the University Academic Governance & Faculty AI Usage Guidelines.\nCreate Account\nAlready have an account? Sign in\nFacultyLens\nAcademic Intelligence Platform\n\nAI-powered decision support for university faculty: analyze assessments, align them with learning outcomes, detect similar questions, grade with rubrics and keep an immutable record of every version — while every decision stays yours.\n\nPRODUCT\nFeatures\nHow it works\nFrom questions to outcomes\nGet started\nPLATFORM\nSign in\nCreate faculty account\nDashboard\nAssessments\nAcademic analytics\nCAPABILITIES\nQuestion bank\nQuestion generator\nRAG assistant\nAnalysis history\nAI evaluation\nFACULTY DISPATCH\n\nOccasional notes on assessment design and AI governance. No marketing noise.\n\nEmail address\n\nDouble opt-in — we only send after you confirm. Unsubscribe any time from any issue.\n\n© 2026 FacultyLens. All rights reserved.\n\nSmarter Assessments. Better Learning.\n\nAI assists · Faculty decides\nTop"}}
